#: syslog_alerts.php
msgid "Alert command"
msgstr "Naredba upozorenja"

#: syslog_alerts.php
msgid "When an Alert is triggered, run the following command.  The following replacement variables are available <b>'&lt;HOSTNAME&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;ALERTID&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;MESSAGE&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;FACILITY&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;PRIORITY&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;SEVERITY&gt;'</b>.  Please note that <b>'&lt;HOSTNAME&gt;'</b> is only available on individual thresholds.  These replacement values can appear on the command line, or be gathered from the environment of the script.  When used from the environment, those variables will be prefixed with 'ALERT_'."
msgstr "Kada se upozorenje pokrene, izvršite sljedeću naredbu. Dostupne su sljedeće zamjenske varijable <b>'&lt;HOSTNAME&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;ALERTID&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;MESSAGE&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;FACILITY&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;PRIORITY&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;SEVERITY&gt;'</b>. Imajte na umu da je <b>'&lt;HOSTNAME&gt;'</b> dostupan samo na pojedinačnim pragovima. Te zamjenske vrijednosti mogu se navesti u naredbenom retku ili dohvatiti iz okruženja skripte. Kada se koriste iz okruženja, te će varijable imati prefiks 'ALERT_'."

#: syslog_alerts.php
msgid "Recovery command"
msgstr "Naredba oporavka"

#: syslog_alerts.php
msgid "Optional command to run when this threshold recovers after its quiet period. Uses the same replacement variables as Alert command. SYSLOG_EVENT is clear; SYSLOG_BREACH_ID matches the breach command. Failed commands are retried. Leave blank to disable."
msgstr "Neobvezna naredba koja se pokreće kada se ovaj prag oporavi nakon razdoblja mirovanja. Koristi iste zamjenske varijable kao naredba upozorenja. SYSLOG_EVENT je clear; SYSLOG_BREACH_ID odgovara naredbi prekoračenja. Neuspjele naredbe se ponavljaju. Ostavite prazno za onemogućavanje."

