msgstr "Preporuka [uređivanje]"

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Recommendation [new]"
msgstr "Preporuka [novo]"

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "A lightbulb before the message marks matching recommendations on the System Logs and Alert Logs tabs. Click the message to read them in the details flyout. Hovering never requests the server."
msgstr "Žaruljica ispred poruke označava podudarajuće preporuke na karticama Zapisnici sustava i Zapisnici upozorenja. Kliknite poruku da biste ih pročitali u skočnom oknu s pojedinostima. Zadržavanje pokazivača nikada ne šalje zahtjev poslužitelju."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Only the <b>Identifier</b> column is used for matching. The vendor, component, severity, message and explanation are shown in the details flyout but are never searched."
msgstr "Za podudaranje se upotrebljava samo stupac <b>Identifikator</b>. Dobavljač, komponenta, ozbiljnost, poruka i objašnjenje prikazuju se u skočnom oknu s pojedinostima, ali se nikada ne pretražuju."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The first 2,048 characters of the message are split into words. A word is a run of letters, digits and the characters _ . - / that may start with %. Every other character, such as a space, colon, comma or bracket, ends a word. In <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN: Interface Gi0/1, changed state to down</code> the words are <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, <code>Interface</code>, <code>Gi0/1</code>, <code>changed</code>, <code>state</code>, <code>to</code> and <code>down</code>."
msgstr "Prvih 2048 znakova poruke dijeli se na riječi. Riječ je niz slova, znamenki i znakova _ . - / koji može započeti znakom %. Svaki drugi znak, kao što je razmak, dvotočka, zarez ili zagrada, završava riječ. U poruci <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN: Interface Gi0/1, changed state to down</code> riječi su <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, <code>Interface</code>, <code>Gi0/1</code>, <code>changed</code>, <code>state</code>, <code>to</code> i <code>down</code>."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "An identifier matches when it is <b>exactly equal to one whole word</b>, ignoring case. It is not a \"contains\", \"starts with\" or \"ends with\" search, and there are no wildcards: <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> does not match the word <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN-EXT</code>, and <code>UPDOWN</code> does not match <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>."
msgstr "Identifikator se podudara kada je <b>potpuno jednak jednoj cijeloj riječi</b>, neovisno o veličini slova. To nije pretraživanje tipa \"sadrži\", \"počinje s\" ili \"završava s\" te nema zamjenskih znakova: <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> ne podudara se s riječju <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN-EXT</code>, a <code>UPDOWN</code> ne podudara se s <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "A leading <b>%</b> is literal, not a wildcard, and must match the message word as written. An identifier <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> matches the message word <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, not <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>; an identifier without the prefix matches only the unprefixed word."
msgstr "Početni znak <b>%</b> doslovan je, a ne zamjenski znak, te se mora podudarati s riječju u poruci kako je napisana. Identifikator <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> podudara se s riječju u poruci <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, a ne s <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>; identifikator bez prefiksa podudara se samo s riječju bez prefiksa."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "When the syslog host is a Cacti device whose vendor is recognised from its SNMP system description or device template, and recommendations exist for that vendor, only that vendor's recommendations and those without a vendor are checked. Otherwise all vendors are checked, but an identifier made only of digits matches only recommendations without a vendor. When several recommendations match, the longest identifiers are shown first, up to three."
msgstr "Kada je glavno syslog računalo uređaj u sustavu Cacti čiji je dobavljač prepoznat iz njegova SNMP opisa sustava ili predloška uređaja te postoje preporuke za tog dobavljača, provjeravaju se samo preporuke tog dobavljača i one bez dobavljača. U suprotnom se provjeravaju svi dobavljači, ali identifikator sastavljen samo od znamenki podudara se samo s preporukama bez dobavljača. Kada se podudara više preporuka, najdulji identifikatori prikazuju se prvi, najviše tri."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Identifiers that contain other characters, such as the <code>#</code> slot placeholder or the <code>|</code> alternatives in some vendor documentation (for example <code>%ASA|PIX-3-331001</code>), are kept and exported but can never match. Set <b>Can Match</b> to No to list them, and edit them into the exact code, for example <code>%ASA-3-331001</code>."
msgstr "Identifikatori koji sadrže druge znakove, kao što je rezervirano mjesto <code>#</code> za utor ili alternative <code>|</code> u dokumentaciji nekih dobavljača (na primjer <code>%ASA|PIX-3-331001</code>), čuvaju se i izvoze, ali se nikada ne mogu podudarati. Postavite <b>Može se podudarati</b> na Ne da biste ih naveli i uredite ih u točan kod, na primjer <code>%ASA-3-331001</code>."

